          "docs": "Create product group to use in Catalogs owned by the \"operation user_account\".\n- By default, the \"operation user_account\" is the token user_account.\n\nOptional: Business Access: Specify an <code>ad_account_id</code> (obtained via <a href='/docs/api/v5/#operation/ad_accounts/list'>List ad accounts</a>) to use the owner of that ad_account as the \"operation user_account\". In order to do this, the token user_account must have one of the following <a href=\"https://help.pinterest.com/en/business/articl"
        },
